# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day37

## Question 1

The event continued _____ the heavy rain.

A. although
B. despite
C. because
D. while

Answer: B

→ the heavy rain = 명사
→ despite + 명사

---

## Question 2

The event continued _____ it was raining heavily.

A. despite
B. because of
C. although
D. during

Answer: C

→ it was raining = 주어 + 동사
→ although + S + V

---

## Question 3

The meeting was canceled _____ the manager was sick.

A. because
B. because of
C. despite
D. during

Answer: A

→ the manager was sick = S + V
→ because + S + V

---

## Question 4

The meeting was canceled _____ the manager's illness.

A. because
B. although
C. because of
D. while

Answer: C

→ the manager's illness = 명사
→ because of + 명사

---

## Challenge

Employees should not use their phones _____ working.

A. during
B. while
C. because
D. although

Answer: A

→ working = 동명사
→ during + 명사/동명사

---

## Key Point

### 접속사 + S + V

because

although

while

if

when

unless

---

### 전치사 + 명사 / V-ing

because of

despite

during

without

instead of

---

## 기억하기

because + 문장

because of + 명사

although + 문장

despite + 명사

while + 문장

during + 명사
